5. Scope
5.1 In Scope
The scope of this project includes the development of a web-based JPetStore application that provides core e-commerce functionalities for pet product purchasing. Users can register, log in, and manage their personal information through the system. The application allows customers to browse product categories, view product details, manage a shopping cart, and place orders. The project also includes REST API development, database integration, and frontend-backend integration to ensure smooth communication between user interfaces and backend services.
In-Scope Functionalities:
●	User registration
●	User login and authentication
●	User information management
●	Product catalogue and categories
●	Shopping cart management
●	Order creation and order history
●	REST API development
●	Database integration
●	Frontend-backend integration
5.2 Out of Scope
The current implementation focuses on the fundamental features required for an online pet store and excludes advanced integrations and enterprise-level functionalities. Features such as real payment processing, logistics management, and shipment tracking are not included. The project also does not cover mobile application development, advanced recommendation systems, or production infrastructure management. These functionalities may be considered in future versions of the application.
Out-of-Scope Functionalities:
●	Real payment gateway integration
●	Real-time shipment tracking
●	Advanced recommendation systems
●	Native Android/iOS applications
●	Production deployment and infrastructure management
●	Multi-vendor marketplace functionality
●	Email and SMS notifications
●	Automation testing
●	Accessibility testing
●	Security testing
 
